// Insurer logos, embedded so the report stays a standalone file.
//
// The originals ship with wildly different amounts of whitespace baked in - some
// are a small mark centred on a 200x200 canvas - which made them print at
// different sizes no matter how the cell was styled. Each one here has been
// trimmed to its ink and normalised to a common height, so the report's fixed
// logo box is filled the same way by every insurer.
//
// Regenerate with scripts/build-logos.js after adding or replacing a logo.

